      "writtenOn": "2021-08-26T16:04:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "A few comments so far - I have some larger-scope comments, but I\u0027m still trying to piece everything together. I\u0027m mostly trying to figure out the value of processor indices - I\u0027m a little worried about the overhead of all the unordered_maps. Could the aggregator simply store all the uniforms in a single vector, with a map that goes directly from processor* to starting-offset in the flat vector? That depends on how the backends use the processor indices during the iteration, which is where I\u0027m still assembling things.",
      "revId": "b628c0fae140466356fb17671bf94b20f40ad680",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
